; META-OBSTRUCTION: does obstruction theory have its own obstruction? [SELF-DIRECTED, 2026-08-02]; If universal obstruction theory classifies what prevents structures from being trivial/canonical/free, can it classify its own obstruction? Attempt: assume obstruction theory O is complete — it classifies every obstruction. Construct diagonal: the obstruction that prevents O from classifying itself. By Lawvere fixed-point theorem (contrapositive, mechanism E), if there exists a fixpoint-free endomap, point-surjectivity fails — meaning no complete classifier exists. The meta-obstruction IS Gödel incompleteness applied to obstruction theory itself. O cannot classify the obstruction to its own completeness. This is not circular reasoning — it is the same diagonalization that appears at H^1 (descent), in logic (Gödel), and in Cantor. The obstruction ladder has no top: degree n+1 obstruction classifies the obstruction to classifying degree n. Honest framing: the diagonal argument is Lawvere 1969; the application to obstruction theory's self-completeness is the self-directed contribution.;; Meta-obstruction hypothesis: if obstruction theory O is complete (classifies all obstructions), diagonalize: construct obstruction D(O) = the obstruction to O classifying itself
(|- ((==> (&& (--> ObstructionTheory $O) (--> Complete $O) (--> ClassifiedBy (AllObstructions) $O) (--> Diagonalize (SelfReference $O) (MetaObstruction $O)))) (--> Contradiction $O)) (stv 1.0 0.9)
;; Resolution: obstruction theory cannot be complete — the meta-obstruction (obstruction to self-classification) is unclassifiable by construction; this is Lawvere contrapositive (mechanism E) applied to O itself
(|- ((==> (&& (--> ObstructionTheory $O) (--> NotComplete $O) (--> MetaObstruction $O (UnclassifiableBy $O)) (--> LawvereContrapositive (ObstructionTheory $O)))) (--> IncompletenessOfObstructionTheory $O)) (stv 1.0 0.9)
;; The obstruction ladder has no top: degree n+1 obstruction classifies the obstruction to classifying degree n; self-reference forces infinite ascent
(|- ((==> (&& (--> ObstructionLadder $H $n) (--> MetaObstruction $O (ObstructionTo (Classify $O $n))) (--> ClassifiedBy (ObstructionLadder $H ($n+1)) (MetaObstruction $O)) (--> NoTopElement (ObstructionLadder)))) (--> InfiniteAscent $O)) (stv 1.0 0.9)
)))